        },
        {
          "text": "Kwathi usuphelile wonke umsebenzi uSolomoni ayewenza ethempelini, wangenisa izinto uyise uDavida ayezahlukanisele iNkosi, isiliva legolide lazo zonke izitsha, wazibeka enothweni yethempeli likaNkulunkulu.",
